The '''LO-KD57''' was a model of luxury [[sail barge]] manufactured by [[Ubrikkian Industries]]. The [[Hutt]] [[crime lord]] [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]] owned one such [[repulsorcraft]], the ''[[Khetanna]]'', which underwent armament modifications to suit the [[gangster]]'s needs.<ref name="Rebel Files" />

